r_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142676386?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware","html_url":"https://github.com/exlirixsoftware","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/javascript","state":"uploaded","size":293468,"digest":"sha256:9377336fdea3f7a967e16e25defb7b64f8b2e0423f23ebbe4716ed0cd327032c","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-31T09:02:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T09:02:55Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/exlirixsoftware/Tessel.js/releases/download/v.1.1.0/tessel.js"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/exlirixsoftware/Tessel.js/releases/assets/694892824","id":694892824,"node_id":"RA_kwDOUtUFWM4pazkY","name":"tessel.min.js","label":"","uploader":{"login":"exlirixsoftware","id":142676386,"node_id":"U_kgDOCIERog","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142676386?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware","html_url":"https://github.com/exlirixsoftware","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/javascript","state":"uploaded","size":223840,"digest":"sha256:385cb50c9cf2bc9652eb19361f69975650d126d4489db3e5ffdb581b7db1395e","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-31T09:02:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T09:02:55Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/exlirixsoftware/Tessel.js/releases/download/v.1.1.0/tessel.min.js"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/exlirixsoftware/Tessel.js/tarball/v.1.1.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/exlirixsoftware/Tessel.js/zipball/v.1.1.0","body":"## [1.1.0] - 2026-10-31\n\nRestyled on Tailwind CSS v4 and brought up to date with Tessel.NET 1.2.0.\n\n### Changed\n\n- **Styling is now Tailwind CSS v4.** Components are built from utility classes; a build step (`npm run build:css`) compiles them into one shared constructable stylesheet (`src/styles/tailwind.generated.js`) that every shadow root adopts. The generated files are committed, so consuming the library still needs no tooling. Tailwind and its CLI are dev dependencies only.\n- `heading` is now the preferred attribute for `<tsl-info-bar>`, `<tsl-dialog>` and `<tsl-teaching-tip>`; `title` still works but is moved off the element so the browser no longer shows it as a hover tooltip.\n- Dropdowns (`<tsl-select>`, `<tsl-menu-button>`) and the new popups render in the browser's top layer instead of `position:absolute`.\n- `<tsl-dialog>` is built on a native modal `<dialog>`.\n- `<tsl-slider>` is drawn from plain elements (pointer capture + ARIA slider keyboard model) instead of a vendor-styled range input.\n- `<tsl-expander>` and `<tsl-tree-item>` animate a CSS grid row instead of measuring `scrollHeight`.\n- The server in `scripts/serve.js` redirects `/` to `/gallery/index.html`.\n\n### Added\n\n- New controls from Tessel.NET: `<tsl-toggle-button>`, `<tsl-dropdown-button>`, `<tsl-split-button>`, `<tsl-toggle-split-button>`, `<tsl-chip>`, `<tsl-segmented>`, `<tsl-tab-view>`, `<tsl-breadcrumb>`, `<tsl-pagination>`, `<tsl-stepper>`, `<tsl-timeline>`, `<tsl-progress-ring>`, `<tsl-skeleton>`, `<tsl-rating>`, `<tsl-auto-suggest>`, `<tsl-calendar>`, `<tsl-date-picker>`, `<tsl-time-picker>`, `<tsl-color-picker>`, `<tsl-flyout>`, `<tsl-teaching-tip>`, `<tsl-tooltip>`, `<tsl-group-box>`, `<tsl-toolbar>` and `<tsl-animation-timeline>`.\n- `Tessel.dialog.message()` (Tessel.NET's `MessageDialog`), plus `busy` / `reportProgress()` and cancelable `primary-click` on `<tsl-dialog>`.\n- `header` on text fields, text areas, selects and number boxes; `clearable` on `<tsl-text-field>`; `shortcut` on menu items; `selectable` / `sortable` on `<tsl-table>`; `slot=\"action\"` on `<tsl-info-bar>`; `icon` on `<tsl-tab>`.\n- Themed scrollbars: thin, with a thumb colored from the palette (darker on hover) on a transparent track, inside every component and on the host page.\n- Keyboard navigation for lists, trees, tabs, menus, selects, calendars and toolbars.\n- A gallery with Tessel.NET's pages (Buttons, Inputs, Selection, Collections, Feedback, Layout, Menus, Navigation, Dialogs, Animation).\n\n### Fixed\n\n- `<tsl-radio>`: clicking did nothing. A click handler cancelled every selection, because browsers check a radio before its click event fires.\n- Menus, selects, pickers, flyouts and auto-suggest: until first opened, the popup was an invisible `position:fixed` box sitting over its trigger and neighbors, so the first click (on a menu, a toggle button next to a split button, …) hit an invisible menu row. Popups are now popovers from creation, hidden with `display:none` until opened.\n- `<tsl-switch>`: the knob sat 4px from one end of the track and 1px from the other when on.\n- Popups no longer get clipped by `overflow:hidden` ancestors (cards, dialogs, expanders).\n- `<tsl-table>`: cell styling now also works when the table lives inside another component's shadow root.\n- `<tsl-theme-toggle>` stopped following the theme after being detached and re-attached.\n- `<tsl-text-area>`: the `value` attribute is applied after the initial render.\n- `<tsl-number-box>`: typed values outside `min`/`max` are clamped when the field loses focus.\n- Snackbars show above open modal dialogs.\n- The theme no longer sets a 14px `font-size` on `<html>`, which rescaled every `rem` in the host page; it is applied to `<body>` instead.\n- `<tsl-nav-view>`: the pane becomes a slide-over drawer on narrow screens instead of squeezing the content.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/exlirixsoftware/Tessel.js/releases/397364273","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/exlirixsoftware/Tessel.js/releases/397364273/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/exlirixsoftware/Tessel.js/releases/397364273/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/exlirixsoftware/Tessel.js/releases/tag/v.1.0.0","id":397364273,"author":{"login":"exlirixsoftware","id":142676386,"node_id":"U_kgDOCIERog","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142676386?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware","html_url":"https://github.com/exlirixsoftware","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exlirixsoftware/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users